# RuiJing Vietnam factory — source-only repository
#
# This repo tracks source. Build artifacts, dependency trees, model weights
# and generated files are excluded so that `git ls-files --others` stays
# small enough for tools (T3 Code, IDEs) to enumerate.
#
# Symptom this fixes:
#   T3 Code hung on every turn with "GitVcsDriver.review.listUntracked:
#   Git output exceeded 16777216 bytes and was truncated." — the untracked
#   file list was ~29 MB (172k files), over T3's 16 MB output cap, so every
#   status poll failed and the agent spun forever.

